  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A highly pigmented brow pencil with an ultra-fine tip, allowing you to outline hair strokes and create 3D definition.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b>Free of parabens and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This Brow Pencil creates defined brow hair strokes with its highly pigmented, ultra-fine tip. Its colors are all a shade darker than the pomade for 3D definition. Use the brush to gently blend all three stages together to create the perfect REFY brow.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply the pencil tip over brow hairs to give definition.<br>-Use the brush to softly blend all products together.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Synthetic Wax, Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax), Hydrogenated Palm Oil, Synthetic Beeswax, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Ceresin, Hydrogenated Coconut Oil, Polyisobutene, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, 1,3-Bis-(2,4-Diaminophenoxy) Propane HCl, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Polyethylene, C10-18 Triglycerides, Glyceryl Behenate, Polyglyceryl-6 Octastearate, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopherol, Dimethicone, May Contain: CI 77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77491 (Iron Oxides), CI 77019 (Mica), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A highly pigmented brow pencil with an ultra-fine tip, allowing you to outline hair strokes and create 3D definition.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b>Free of parabens and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This Brow Pencil creates defined brow hair strokes with its highly pigmented, ultra-fine tip. Its colors are all a shade darker than the pomade for 3D definition. Use the brush to gently blend all three stages together to create the perfect REFY brow.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply the pencil tip over brow hairs to give definition.<br>-Use the brush to softly blend all products together.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Synthetic Wax, Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax), Hydrogenated Palm Oil, Synthetic Beeswax, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Ceresin, Hydrogenated Coconut Oil, Polyisobutene, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, 1,3-Bis-(2,4-Diaminophenoxy) Propane HCl, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Polyethylene, C10-18 Triglycerides, Glyceryl Behenate, Polyglyceryl-6 Octastearate, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopherol, Dimethicone, May Contain: CI 77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77491 (Iron Oxides), CI 77019 (Mica), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).</div></details>",
